+# W00-SOL-20260817T234806Z — Root-turn handoff
+
+## Disposition
+
+`BLOCKED_REQUIRES_DESIGN_REVIEW`
+
+The approved design requires untrusted PR code to be unable to forge the four trusted required checks. GitHub repository rulesets bind a required status check to its context name and expected GitHub App, but both trusted default-branch workflows and PR-controlled workflows use the same GitHub Actions App (`15368`). The authorized design excludes a separate GitHub App/credential, protected-environment approval, and an organization-level required-workflow control. The required provenance boundary therefore cannot be implemented faithfully within W00's activated design.
+
+## Identity
+
+- Project / task / activation: `biblical-scholar-lab` / `W00` / `ACT-W00-REPOSITORY-GOVERNANCE-v3`
+- Branch / base: `codex/w00-repository-governance` / `3d3ebb706fe6c8779445cbbfd9fea271b86d3646`
+- Implementation head: `516254fff643371f4315376a4a2ee0f5aaaaad64`
+- Draft PR: https://github.com/abbudjoe/biblical-scholar-lab/pull/1
+- GitHub actor / auth: `abbudjoe` / `GH_CLI_EXISTING_AUTH`
+- Handoff commit: non-self-referential; the completion comment records the exact live PR head containing this pair.
+
+## DoD ledger
+
+| Item | State | Evidence or gap |
+|---|---|---|
+| Immutable base, branch, activation hash, design ancestry | met | Protected-base resolution and SHA-256 validation pass. |
+| Activated scope and non-goals | met | Five implementation files; no domain, source, benchmark, model, cloud, training, database, or UI work. |
+| Four exact check names on draft PR | met | Run 32082062736; project passes, pre-handoff/review/authorization gates fail closed as sequenced. |
+| Non-forgeable default-branch checks | blocked | Same GitHub Actions App identity is available to PR-controlled workflows. |
+| CLI policy | partial | Independent review found refspec, wrapper, shorthand-token, exact-merge, and phase-label bypasses. |
+| Exact-head review and owner authorization | partial | Head matching works; evidence binding, ordering, and cross-head reuse checks need repair. |
+| Append-only handoff proof | partial | Parent/pair checks exist; added-only and filename-to-turn identity checks need repair. |
+| DR-30/budget enforcement | partial | Mechanical limits pass; dependency/public-contract/migration/class checks remain incomplete. |
+| Live repository posture | met | Merge policy, review limit, ruleset, effective rules, and CODEOWNERS readback validate. |
+| Independent conformance review | blocked | `REPAIR_REQUIRED`; blocked-state repair rereviewed clean with the design blocker remaining. |
+| Final handoff protocol | met | This commit is restricted to this Markdown/JSON pair; JSON points to its first parent. |
+| Formal ChatGPT review, owner approval, W00 manual merge, post-merge proof | pending | Must not occur until design review and repair produce a new exact head. |
+
+## Implementation and live mutations
+
+- Added `.github/workflows/governance-integrity.yml`, `governance/w00_contracts.py`, `governance/w00_checks.py`, tests, and command-policy fixtures.
+- Added the narrow blocked-disposition repair so a design-review blocker is represented honestly.
+- Idempotently enforced squash-only merging, disabled merge commits/rebase/auto-merge, and enabled merged-branch deletion through the authorized `gh repo edit` interface.
+- Enabled `Limit to users explicitly granted read or higher access` through GitHub's authenticated supported browser UI; saved state and persisted checked state were observed after reload.
+- Created ruleset `20960975` through `POST /repos/abbudjoe/biblical-scholar-lab/rulesets`: active, `~DEFAULT_BRANCH`, empty bypass, PR required, zero approvals, no code-owner approval, conversations resolved, linear history, deletion/force-push protection, and four strict checks pinned to App `15368`.
